  - Media (`.promo-bg`, `.zeimenos-feature-img`, `.feature-board-media`): `min-height: 300px; overflow: hidden;` with `img { object-fit: cover; transition: transform 900ms var(--ease); }` scaling to `1.04` on board hover.
