## 8. Rules for Future Edits

1. **Use only existing tokens and components**: Reference CSS variables (`--bg`, `--bg-soft`, `--text`, `--text-muted`, `--accent`, `--border`, `--sp-*`, `--fs-*`, `--radius`, `--ease`) and documented component classes in this file.
